menu "Matter2Supla gateway"

    config M2S_SINGLE_USB_RCP_OTA
        bool "Single USB-C build: remote ESP32-C6 RCP OTA over UART1"
        default n
        help
            Enables the /api/gateway/update-rcp endpoint and the boot-time
            transfer of a staged, signed C6 RCP image (M2SRCP1) over UART1.
            Requires the C6 to run the 2xOTA RCP firmware from
            firmware/c6-rcp-ota. The firmware version gets
            the "-singleusb" suffix and FW_BUILD_BASE + 1, so both variants
            never share one build number.

endmenu
